{'symbol': 'TXN', 'date': '2021-07-12 01:01:00', 'title': 'NEW MCU PORTFOLIO REDEFINES MICROCONTROLLER PERFORMANCE, ENABLING 10 TIMES HIGHER PROCESSING CAPABILITY THAN EXISTING DEVICES', 'text': 'DALLAS, JULY 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TEXAS INSTRUMENTS (TI) (NASDAQ: TXN) TODAY INTRODUCED A NEW HIGH-PERFORMANCE MICROCONTROLLER (MCU) PORTFOLIO THAT ADVANCES REAL-TIME CONTROL, NETWORKING AND ANALYTICS APPLICATIONS AT THE EDGE. WITH NEW SITARA AM2X MCUS, ENGINEERS CAN ACHIEVE 10 TIMES THE COMPUTING CAPABILITY OF TRADITIONAL, FLASH-BASED MCUS.'}